# VHS recording: diary edit workflow
# Shows editing today's entry with vim

Output docs/screenshots/edit-workflow.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type "diary ttal edit"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

# vim opens with blank file
Type "# Today's Reflection"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Enter
Type "Spent time understanding the encryption model."
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Type "Key insight: tools designed for humans work equally for agents."
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1s

# Exit vim (ESC then :wq)
Escape
Sleep 300ms
Type ":wq"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
